.sectaux 0 Abstract
.underline off
.justify
.sp
This document describes a system similar to Objective-C
as outlined by Brad Cox [Cox86].
The system combines version 2 classes and methods with version 4
syntax.
Ports to other bases are planned for the future.
Herein is described the usage and structure of a "C" preprocessor
for ${oo} programming.
Future directions are discussed.
A bibliography of related materials is also included.
.!
.restore
